>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Interactively reviewed graph. W–N–O 176.11°, N–O 1.20865 Å, g-xTB N–O WBO 1.4454. The closed-shell assignment for this near-linear terminal ligand is N≡[O+], with metal formal charge +0 and total charge +1. The crystal locates the coordinated pyrrole derivative and TpW(NO)(PMe₃); The W(0)/NO⁺ core is consistent with the reported series and the cation electron count, Electronic assignments of the ancillary ligands require separate review. Localized 15 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. The atom order and coordinates of all 62 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 61 nonmetal covalent bonds: 55 within range, 1 outside range and 5 with sparse controls. Examples outside range: 36–37 C-H 1.0923 Å. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

