>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Manually reviewed Lewis representation. The sulfonated phosphine ligand contains C20H18; The discrepancy is confined to the C4H5 fragment. The same-ID formula requires C4H7. Agreement between reconstructions of the fixed input cannot distinguish an allyl group from a dehydrogenated enynyl group. Localized 18 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Checked each ligand's bond orders and formal charges against the input geometry. The atom order and coordinates of all 55 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 55 nonmetal covalent bonds: 54 within range, 0 outside range and 1 with sparse controls. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

